                    <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Eligible arrivals: completed, non-diverted flights with recorded arrival delay.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Median and P90 include only eligible arrivals delayed ≥15 minutes. Reported minutes can span multiple cuase categories per flight.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
